      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "batman",
      "text": "He's raiding secondary tactical caches I established in 2018.",
      "durationSeconds": 3.6,
      "audio": {
        "file": "assets/audio/how-batman-sleeps/turn-02.wav",
        "authorized": true,
        "provenance": "Fish Audio voice model"
      },
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "HE'S RAIDING SECONDARY CACHES",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 1.8
        },
        {
          "text": "I ESTABLISHED IN 2018.",
          "start": 1.8,
          "end": 3.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "robin",
      "text": "Wait. You're telling me Red Hood is literally using your own old gear to execute mobsters?",
      "durationSeconds": 4.8,
      "audio": {
        "file": "assets/audio/how-batman-sleeps/turn-03.wav",
        "authorized": true,
        "provenance": "Fish Audio voice model"
      },
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "WAIT. RED HOOD IS USING YOUR",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.4
        },
        {
          "text": "OLD GEAR TO EXECUTE MOBSTERS?",
          "start": 2.4,
          "end": 4.8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "batman",
      "text": "When Jason was Robin, he memorized the 24-character cryptographic cypher for my emergency armories. I chose not to change the master password.",
      "durationSeconds": 7.4,
      "audio": {
        "file": "assets/audio/how-batman-sleeps/turn-04.wav",
        "authorized": true,
        "provenance": "Fish Audio voice model"
      },
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "HE MEMORIZED THE 24-CHAR",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.4
        },
        {
          "text": "CYPHER FOR MY ARMORIES. I DID",
          "start": 2.4,
          "end": 4.8
        },
        {
          "text": "NOT CHANGE THE PASSWORD.",
          "start": 4.8,
          "end": 7.4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "robin",
      "text": "You didn't change the password?! Bruce, you have biometric voice encryption on your toaster, but you left weapons caches on default settings for your rogue son?",
      "durationSeconds": 7.8,
      "audio": {
        "file": "assets/audio/how-batman-sleeps/turn-05.wav",
        "authorized": true,
        "provenance": "Fish Audio voice model"
      },
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "YOU HAVE BIOMETRICS ON YOUR",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.6
        },
        {
          "text": "TOASTER, BUT LEFT WEAPONS ON",
          "start": 2.6,
          "end": 5.2
        },
        {
          "text": "DEFAULT SETTINGS FOR JASON?!",
          "start": 5.2,
          "end": 7.8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "batman",
      "text": "If I locked him out, he would resort to buying unstable black-market ordnance from the Russian mob. Sub-standard munitions have a 14% higher collateral casualty rate among civilians.",
      "durationSeconds": 8.6,
      "audio": {
        "file": "assets/audio/how-batman-sleeps/turn-06.wav",
        "authorized": true,
        "provenance": "Fish Audio voice model"
      },
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "HE WOULD BUY UNSTABLE AMMO",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.8
        },
        {
          "text": "FROM THE RUSSIAN MOB. BAD AMMO",
          "start": 2.8,
          "end": 5.6
        },
        {
          "text": "HAS A 14% HIGHER CASUALTY RATE.",
          "start": 5.6,
          "end": 8.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "robin",
      "text": "So you're subsidizing his vigilante rampage with high-grade Kevlar and precision ammunition so he doesn't accidentally blow up a city block?!",
      "durationSeconds": 6.8,
      "audio": {
        "file": "assets/audio/how-batman-sleeps/turn-07.wav",
        "authorized": true,
        "provenance": "Fish Audio voice model"
      },
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "SO YOU'RE SUBSIDIZING HIM WITH",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.2
        },
        {
          "text": "PRECISION AMMO SO HE DOESN'T",
          "start": 2.2,
          "end": 4.5
        },
        {
          "text": "BLOW UP A CITY BLOCK?!",
          "start": 4.5,
          "end": 6.8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "batman",
      "text": "It's risk mitigation, Tim. Parenting a dead Robin requires tactical compromises.",
      "durationSeconds": 4.8,
      "audio": {
        "file": "assets/audio/how-batman-sleeps/turn-08.wav",
        "authorized": true,
        "provenance": "Fish Audio voice model"
